/-!
# Literal witnesses for the G₂(2) flag action

The ordering is exactly that of the saved 189-flag cycle calculation.
`source/Generate.py` renders the GAP witnesses in `source/witnesses.json`.
The accompanying geometry and action modules prove their interpretation on
the actual unipotent cosets; definitions alone certify no group action.

GAP right cosets U r are sent to Lean left cosets r⁻¹ U, and actors are
inverted. The eight root/Weyl actors are involutions. Cycle matrices use
column action, hence transpose GAP's row-action matrices.

Source application: Aschbacher–Smith G.7.2(3), printed p.348 / PDF p.359.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace G2DerivedPermutationFiltration.CycleFlagCoordinates

open VertexCoordinates

